# Telegram Source

Telegram Bot API adapter for delivering monitoring events with proper markdown escaping and thread support.

## Key Integration Pattern
Uses go-telegram/bot client with MarkdownV2 formatting and thread-aware message routing for organized notifications.

## Important Constraints
- Escape special markdown characters (-, ., _) for Telegram's strict MarkdownV2 parser
- Support optional ThreadID for topic-based channel organization
- Track delivery errors by type (invalid_chat_id, send_message) for debugging